 (text "Control and SPI nets connect to host MCU; mux A0/A1/A2 shared, EN active high. Drive EN low during address updates." (at 235 35 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)))) (text "J2 2x8 ribbon: odd pins VEXC_2V5, even pins FSR0_NODE through FSR7_NODE. Each sensor is independent at AINx / U2 Sx." (at 85 20 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)))) (text "U1 ADS1256 power: AVDD +5VA, DVDD +3V3. D0-D3 and XTAL pins exposed for system clock/GPIO. SYNC/PDWN and RESET require pull-up/control." (at 235 155 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2))))

